<div id="A3.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ C.4 Ablation of Grad-CAM++ Percentage ‣ Appendix C Additional Experiments ‣ Dataset Color Quantization: A Training-Oriented Framework for Dataset-Level Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> presents the performance under different Grad-CAM++ retention percentages. The results indicate that preserving 50% of the pixels achieves the best performance.</p>
</div>
